Troubleshooting Tips
Ceph health warnings? Check OSD status with ceph osd stat.
Cinder volume creation fails? Verify /etc/ceph/ceph.client.cinder.keyring permissions.
OpenStack-Ceph connectivity issues? Ensure firewall rules allow TCP/6789 (Ceph Monitors).
